<article data-history-node-id="105424" class="node node--type-page node--view-mode-full clearfix">
  <header class="header">
    
        
      </header>
  <div class="node__content clearfix">
    <div class="node_view"><ul class="pre_links"><li class="print"><a href="/node/105424/printable/print" target="_blank">Print</a></li><li class="pdf"><a href="/node/105424/printable/pdf" target="_blank">PDF</a></li></ul></div><div class="gavias-builder--content">		  	<div class="gbb-row-wrapper section row-first-level gbb-row bg-size-cover"  style=""  data-onepage-title="Intro">
		  			    	<div class="bb-inner default">  
		      	<div class="bb-container container">
			        	<div class="row row-wrapper">
							
		<div  class="gsc-column col-xl-12 col-lg-12 col-md-12 col-sm-12 col-12" >
	      <div class="column-inner bg-size-cover">
	         <div class="column-content-inner">
	           <div class="column-content  " ><p>This page provides links to environmental agencies, data tools, mapping resources, professional organizations, and training resources commonly used by Tennessee county officials. Resources are organized by program area to support county operations, planning, environmental compliance, public works, and local decision-making.</p></div><div class="column-content  " ><hr style="border: none; border-top: 2px solid #ff8200; width: 100%;" /></div>	         </div>  
	      </div>
        
	    </div>
	   	     	 			</div>
    				</div>
  				</div>  
			  				</div>  
				  	<div class="gbb-row-wrapper section row-first-level gbb-row bg-size-cover"  style=""  data-onepage-title="Highlighted Projects">
		  			    	<div class="bb-inner default">  
		      	<div class="bb-container container">
			        	<div class="row row-wrapper">
							
		<div  class="gsc-column col-xl-12 col-lg-12 col-md-12 col-sm-12 col-12" >
	      <div class="column-inner bg-size-cover">
	         <div class="column-content-inner">
	           
         <div class="widget gsc-heading  align-left style-1 padding-bottom-0 padding-top-0" style="max-width: 800px;" >
            
            <div class="heading-content clearfix">
               <div class="sub-title fweight-500 text-gray"><span>See what we've been up to!</span></div>               <h2 class="title fweight-600 text-black">
                  <span>Featured Projects</span>
               </h2>                                 <div class="title-desc text-gray"><p style="caret-color: #000000; color: #000000; font-style: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; white-space: normal; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; text-decoration-line: none; text-decoration-thickness: auto; text-decoration-style: solid; margin-top: 0px; margin-bottom: 0px;">Explore selected CTAS mapping, drone, environmental, and county operations projects. These examples demonstrate how geographic information systems can support planning, infrastructure management, environmental compliance, public communication, and local decision-making.</p>
<p>&nbsp;</p></div>
                           </div>
            
            
         </div>
         <div class="clearfix"></div>
