				  	<div class="gbb-row-wrapper section row-first-level gbb-row bg-size-cover"  style=""  data-onepage-title="Solid Waste Management">
		  			    	<div class="bb-inner default">  
		      	<div class="bb-container container">
			        	<div class="row row-wrapper">
							
		<div  class="gsc-column col-xl-8 col-lg-8 col-md-8 col-sm-12 col-12" >
	      <div class="column-inner bg-size-cover">
	         <div class="column-content-inner">
	           
         <div class="widget gsc-heading  align-left style-1 padding-bottom-0" style="max-width: 800px;" >
            
            <div class="heading-content clearfix">
                              <h2 class="title fweight-600 text-black">
                  <span>Solid Waste Management</span>
               </h2>                           </div>
            
            
         </div>
         <div class="clearfix"></div>
         <div class="column-content  " ><p>Resources related to municipal solid waste, Class I and Class III landfills, convenience centers, transfer stations, recycling, composting, recovered materials, waste tires, household hazardous waste, permitting, and county solid waste planning.</p></div>
         <div class="widget gsc-heading  align-left style-1 padding-bottom-0 padding-top-0" style="max-width: 800px;" >
            
            <div class="heading-content clearfix">
                              <h3 class="title fsize-18 fweight-600 text-black">
                  <span>Tennessee Solid Waste Resources</span>
               </h3>                           </div>
            
            
         </div>
         <div class="clearfix"></div>
         <div class="column-content  " ><ul>
<li><a href="https://www.tn.gov/environment/program-areas/solid-waste/sw.html">TDEC Solid Waste Program</a></li>
<li><a href="https://www.tn.gov/environment/program-areas/solid-waste.html">TDEC Waste Management Branch</a></li>
